        }
      }
    },
    "まだレア粒の扱いを選んでいません。説明なしで抽選creditを貯め始めないため、最初の実測タイマーより前に確認します。" : {
      "comment" : "Rare-gem choice before the first timed focus: why it is asked now (no draw credits are collected without an explanation)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You haven't chosen how rare gems work yet. So that no draw credits build up without an explanation, we ask before your first timed focus."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まだレア粒の扱いを選んでいません。説明なしで抽選creditを貯め始めないため、最初の実測タイマーより前に確認します。"
          }
        }
      }
